msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:97
msgid "Storefront visibility"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:98
msgid "Controls whether the registry feature appears to customers and guests. Both options are on by default, so registries work the moment the plugin is active, no setup required."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:102
msgid "Enable gift registries"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:108
msgid "Show gift registries on the storefront."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:110
msgid "Master switch. Turn off to hide everything at once, the \"Add to registry\" button on products, the My Account → Gift Registries area, and every shared public registry page stop rendering. Existing registries are kept and reappear when you switch this back on. On by default."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:114
msgid "Allow direct purchase"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:120
msgid "Let guests buy registry items straight from the shared page."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:122
msgid "On (recommended): a guest clicks \"Buy this gift\" on the registry and the item drops into their cart in one step. Gifts that need options picked first, such as a variable product with a size or colour, always show \"Choose options\" and open the product page instead, the registry is remembered so the gift still counts. Off: every item sends guests to the product page. Has no effect unless gift registries are enabled above."
msgstr ""

